The wind so swift, sky high, apes wail in sorrow;  
<dfn title="Clear islet in the river">Islets clear</dfn>, white sands, birds swirl in air.  

Leaves endless fall with <dfn title="Rustling sound of autumn foliage">rustling sound</dfn>;  
The ceaseless Yangtze rolls on bound.  

<dfn title="Far in space, far from home">Ten thousand leagues</dfn> in autumn sad, <dfn title="A perpetual traveler">always a guest</dfn>;  
<dfn title="In old age, a lifetime's struggle">A hundred years</dfn> of illness, <dfn title="Ascending the high terrace alone">alone I climb</dfn>.  

Hardships and bitter grief <dfn title="Frosty white hair at temples">frost my temples</dfn>;  
<dfn title="Desolate and frail, forced to give up wine due to illness">Frustrated, newly forced to drop the murky wine cup</dfn>.
